    "body": "fix on issue/1752-inside-out-fixture · PR #1761 · pinned by winding_align::the_inside_out_stl_fixture_is_turned_outward_at_import_and_lays · merges when reviewed\n\nFinding: the failure is deterministic. The test failed in 5 of 5 local runs on origin/main 4141eb1. The cause is PR #1686 (#1672). That PR turns a closed, isolated inward STL body outward at import and adds a note. The test still expected the old refusal. The PR changes only the test. The refusal of an unturned inside-out body and the import refusal of a nested inward shell stay pinned.\n",
